{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/07/4878538/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーの間で風邪が流行中"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/07/4878538/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もちょっと鼻かぜがひどくて頭がぼーっとしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/07/4878538/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンにもティッシュケースを抱えていきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近レッスン帰りに、クールなあしゅかに\nとにかく熱く語ることにハマってます\n人生について、とか　笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は駅でマーチールーサーキングの演説をしました＜o(￣＾￣)o＞ エッヘン!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アーイハバドゥリーム。\n・・・あと適当　笑\n雰囲気で続ける"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/07/4878538/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか風邪で声が低いからしっくり来ました。\nあしゅかがウケてくれたからうれしい＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"て、どうでもいい話\n風邪で頭が回らないので、今日のブログは以上で<(_ _)>"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/07/4878538/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅかの話したのに写真はゆみ姉っていうね。。。\nゆるして〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/07/4878538/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉と同じくPCから上手く更新できません！\nガッデム"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/07/4878538/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/